  "annotations": [
    {
      "id": "note",
      "type": "note",
      "text": "Cook opt 02 \u2014 effects, wireless Select, downstream of a still node\n\nWindow title: \"02 effects, select, downstream\".\nLeft to right, top row then bottom row. Select cells have NO wires. They name their target.\n\n1 Glitch intensity 0, channel shift 0, tears 0. STILL cyan circle. Same as cell 8.\n2 Glitch intensity 0.85 with shift and tears. The circle BREAKS and keeps changing.\n3 Film grain intensity 0. STILL clean circle.\n4 Film grain 0.85. SPARKLE that keeps changing.\n5 LevelTOP on a still NoiseTOP (brighter). STILL noise, not black.\n6 SelectTOP named noise_live. SCROLLING noise, not black. No wire into the Select.\n7 SelectTOP named noise_still. STILL noise, not black.\n8 The plain cyan circle. STILL. Reference for cells 1 and 3.\n\nFail if Select is black, the level cell is black, a still cell moves, or a live cell freezes.",
      "position": [
